# ---- Unity generated folders ----
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset meta data should only be ignored when the corresponding asset is also ignored
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# ---- Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code caches ----
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
/*.csproj
/*.unityproj
/*.sln
/*.suo
/*.tmp
/*.user
/*.userprefs
/*.pidb
/*.booproj
/*.svd
/*.pdb
/*.mdb
/*.opendb
/*.VC.db

# ---- Crash / diagnostic dumps ----
mono_crash.*
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# ---- Build artifacts ----
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# ---- Large 3D art (temporarily excluded) ----
# ~700 MB, and Rig(Met2ata3).glb alone is 149 MB, past GitHub's hard 100 MB
# per-file limit. The models are also being re-cut for Quest, so committing
# them now would spend the repo's size budget on a version about to be
# replaced. Must be committed from Abdul's machine when the time comes, so the
# .meta GUIDs the scene depends on are preserved. See docs/art-and-assets.md.
Assets/_Prefabs/Environments/**/*.glb
Assets/_Prefabs/Environments/**/*.glb.meta
Assets/_Prefabs/Environments/3d/
Assets/_Prefabs/Environments/textures/
Assets/Source Files/Models/Backgrounds/

# ---- OS noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
